From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 16:43:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: add DisplayPort
 audio

Add the DisplayPort playback link to the sound card, from the DSP's
DISPLAY_PORT_RX_0 port to the DP controller's audio codec, so that a
monitor on the USB-C port can play sound.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts  | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 7455dda42ece..71d2e65c0627 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -388,6 +388,22 @@
 				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
 			};
 		};
+
+		displayport-0-dai-link {
+			link-name = "DisplayPort0 Playback";
+
+			codec {
+				sound-dai = <&mdss_dp0>;
+			};
+
+			cpu {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apmbedai DISPLAY_PORT_RX_0>;
+			};
+
+			platform {
+				sound-dai = <&q6apm>;
+			};
+		};
 	};
 
 	pogo_vcc: pogo-vcc-regulator {
